{"title":"What should I ask Dan Wang?","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/926795354/0/marginalrevolution~What-should-I-ask-Dan-Wang.html","date":1761514515000,"content":"<p>Yes, I will be doing a podcast with him.  Dan first became famous on the internet with <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.google.com/search?q=dan+wang+christmas+letter&amp;sca_esv=6e39c7eb808723cd&amp;source=hp&amp;ei=BpP-aKzxOaqe5NoPh9CA8Ak&amp;iflsig=AOw8s4IAAAAAaP6hFlS6JjG2eRHGslvAjRQg-gNDKI49&amp;ved=0ahUKEwisjNP358KQAxUqD1kFHQcoAJ4Q4dUDCBo&amp;uact=5&amp;oq=dan+wang+christmas+letter&amp;gs_&amp;sclient=gws-wiz\" target=\"_blank\">his excellent Christmas letters</a>.  More recently, Dan is the author of the NYT bestselling book <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.amazon.com/Breakneck-Chinas-Quest-Engineer-Future/dp/1324106034\" target=\"_blank\">Breakneck: China’s Quest to Engineer the Future</a>.</p>\r\n<p>Here is <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dan_Wang\" target=\"_blank\">Dan Wang on Wikipedia</a>, here is <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/danwwang?ref_src=twsrc%5Egoogle%7Ctwcamp%5Eserp%7Ctwgr%5Eauthor\" target=\"_blank\">Dan on Twitter</a>.  I have known him for some while.  So what should I ask him?</p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/10/what-should-i-ask-dan-wang.html\">What should I ask Dan Wang?</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/926795354/0/marginalrevolution\" />\r\n<div><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/28/926795354/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/fblik